{"id":"5e157b5303bf9951","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-cofinal.md","title":"归约共尾子集","display":"df-cofinal — 归约共尾子集","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-cofinal","aliases":["56-df-cofinal"],"display":"df-cofinal — 归约共尾子集","depends_on":["[[56-df-relation-closure]]","[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]"],"source_section":"§1.1 Definition 1.1.15(iv)","source_printed_pages":"14","source_ocr_blocks":[35],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-cofinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-cofinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cofinal — 归约共尾子集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.1 Definition 1.1.15(iv)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"14"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>35</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>；单关系ARS见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq A\">\\(B\\subseteq A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^*\">\\(\\to^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cofinal}(A,\\to,B)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(a\\to^*b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cofinal}(A,\\to,B)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(a\\to^*b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>共尾方向是任意a可以归约到B中的某点；与B中的点都能归约到a相反。用于归约图内时，A和关系均须取诱导的归约图。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\to\\subseteq A^2$；单关系ARS见 [[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B\\subseteq A$；$\\to^*$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cofinal}(A,\\to,B)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;(a\\to^*b).","display":true}],"bytes":1109,"backlinks":[{"id":"e22d9797b2ac34d5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cofinal}$ 的归约方向见 [[56-df-cofinal]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-cofinal.md]]"}],"outgoing":["9ddd157960e9574a","89129816153530db"]}